{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2023-01-27 16:15:00', 'title': 'MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. TO HOST 2023 ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS', 'text': 'FINDLAY, OHIO , JAN. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. (NYSE: MPC) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT ITS ANNUAL MEETING OF SHAREHOLDERS WILL TAKE PLACE APRIL 26, 2023, AT 10 A.M. ET IN A VIRTUAL-ONLY FORMAT VIA LIVE WEBCAST.'}{'symbol': 'MPC', 'date': '2023-01-27 12:55:00', 'title': 'MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'FINDLAY, OHIO , JAN. 27, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF MARATHON PETROLEUM CORP. (NYSE: MPC) HAS DECLARED A DIVIDEND OF $0.75 PER SHARE ON COMMON STOCK. THE DIVIDEND IS PAYABLE MARCH 10, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AS OF THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS FEB. 16,\xa02023.'}